<title>NETHERLANDS: ING SEES STOCK LISTING IN U.S. IN JUNE.</title>
<headline>ING SEES STOCK LISTING IN U.S. IN JUNE.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services group ING Groep NV (ING) said on Wednesday its previously announced New York Stock Exchange listing would occur in June of this year.</p>
<p>&quot;ING Groep will thus broaden its shareholders' base in the United States and gain easier access to the largest capital market in the world,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>An ING spokesman said the listing would probably not include an issue of new shares.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
